# Selenium WebDriver Automation

## About

This repository contains my hands-on practice with **Selenium WebDriver using Java**. I created it to strengthen my automation testing skills by practicing Selenium concepts, writing clean code, and learning industry-standard automation techniques.

I regularly update this repository as I learn new topics and improve my knowledge in Selenium automation.

## Tech Stack

* Java
* Selenium WebDriver
* Maven
* TestNG
* Eclipse IDE
* Git & GitHub

## What You'll Find

* Beginner-friendly Selenium programs
* Organized examples for different Selenium concepts
* Clean and easy-to-understand code
* Practical web automation exercises
* Regular updates with new concepts

## Topics Covered

* WebDriver Setup
* Browser Commands
* Navigation Commands
* Locators
* XPath
* CSS Selectors
* WebElement Methods
* Waits
* Dropdowns
* Checkboxes & Radio Buttons
* Alerts
* Window & Tab Handling
* Frames
* Mouse Actions
* Keyboard Actions
* JavaScript Executor
* Screenshots
* And more as I continue learning...

